# Allow-list: the only list of what goes into the Director/Hub image (the Dockerfile copies the whole context).
# Keeps local data, runs, tokens and analysis out of the build. deploy/deploy.sh reads the `!` lines as the image's
# inputs (its -dirty check and the files it ships to the build host); CI checks the image holds every file the
# code reads at run time (scripts/image-files.mjs).
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages
!registry
!sets
!prompts
!engine
!deps
!scripts
!docs/METHODOLOGY.md
!docs/legal
!highlights
!deploy/lobby.json
**/node_modules
packages/site/dist
packages/site/dist-data
scripts/bench/dist
**/__pycache__
